<main>
    <div class="form-wrapper">
        <form id="create-user-form" class="create-form" method="POST" action="/register">
            <h3>Create Profile</h3>
            <label class="form-label" for="name">Name:</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
                <br>
            <label class="form-label" for="username">Username:</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" id="username" name="username" required>
                <br>
            <label class="form-label" for="emailAddress">Email (optional):</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" id="emailAddress" name="emailAddress">
                <br>
            <label class="form-label" for="password">Password:</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" value="Family1$" id="password" name="password" required>
                <br>
            <label class="form-label" for="confirm-password">Confirm Password:</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" id="confirm-password" name="confirm-password" required>
                <br>
            <p id="password">Passwords must be 8 or more characters and include a capital, number and special character.</p>
            <button type="reset" class="form-submit-button">Cancel</button>
            <button type="submit" id="register-submit-button" class="form-submit-button">Create</button>
            <p>Already have an account? Click <a href="/login">here</a> to login.</p>
                
            <p>
                Welcome to the RIC3 Fam Hub. Email is optional for the user profile, but necessary if you are joining an event that requires a waiver. To join an event, login to the Hub, click Event on the menu bar, find your event and then click the “join event” button. Please note, there is a chat feature for Events you have joined. On the Search page, you will be able to search other RIC3 Fam members and check out our different Groups and join any you are interested in staying up to date on. If you have any questions, text Wilkin Lai at (313) 525-1255 or email Wilkin@RIC3Family.com.
            </p>
        </form>
    </div>

    <a id="error-label" hidden></a>
    <script src="/public/js/registerValidation.js"></script>
</main>
